\u00b0 images of various homes, apartments, and commercial spaces from the comfort of your own VR headset. Customize your experience based on your specific requirements, whether you\u2019re searching for a cozy apartment, a spacious family home, or a prime investment opportunity.\n\nKey Features:\n\nImmersive Walkthroughs: Experience properties as if you were there, allowing you to assess layouts and designs in detail.\n\nCustomizable Viewing: Tailor your property searches based on size, style, and amenities that fit your lifestyle.\n\nUser-Friendly Interface: Easily browse and select properties, making your search intuitive and enjoyable.\n\nSave Favorites: Bookmark your top choices for quick access and comparison later.\n\nWhether you\u2019re in the market for a new home or simply exploring your options, WoX Builder provides a unique and engaging way to visualize spaces. Dive into your next property adventure today", "short_description": "Experience properties like never before with WoX Builder Explore your dream homes in immersive 360\u00b0. Whether you\u2019re buying, renting, or browsing, discover the perfect space tailored to your needs."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mindwox.com/wox-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MindWoX", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mindwox.com/woxbuilder/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "TRACKED_KEYBOARD"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "RO